,{},[214,297,262],{},[253,299,300,301,304,305,308,309,312,313,316],{},"The event name, such as ",[214,302,303],{},"order.paid",", ",[214,306,307],{},"refund.completed",", or ",[214,310,311],{},"subscription_plan.update_approved",". See the ",[219,314,221],{"href":315},"\u002Fguides\u002Fwebhooks#event-types"," for the full list.",[235,318,319,324,329],{},[253,320,321],{},[214,322,323],{},"reason",[253,325,326],{},[214,327,328],{},"string | null",[253,330,331,332,335,336,339,340,304,343,308,346,349],{},"Why the event fired, for events with more than one cause. Always present; ",[214,333,334],{},"null"," for every event except ",[214,337,338],{},"subscription.updated",", where it is ",[214,341,342],{},"updated_immediately",[214,344,345],{},"updated_on_renewal",[214,347,348],{},"renewed",". New values may be added over time.",[235,351,352,357,361],{},[253,353,354],{},[214,355,356],{},"entityType",[253,358,359],{},[214,360,262],{},[253,362,363,364,304,367,304,370,304,373,304,376,308,379,222],{},"The resource type the event refers to, such as ",[214,365,366],{},"order",[214,368,369],{},"refund",[214,371,372],{},"subscription",[214,374,375],{},"checkout",[214,377,378],{},"one_off_product",[214,380,381],{},"subscription_plan",[235,383,384,389,393],{},[253,385,386],{},[214,387,388],{},"entityId",[253,390,391],{},[214,392,262],{},[253,394,395],{},"The ID of the related resource.",[235,397,398,403,407],{},[253,399,400],{},[214,401,402],{},"object",[253,404,405],{},[214,406,402],{},[253,408,409,410,412,413,416,417,419,420,423,424,222],{},"The full resource payload as it existed when the event occurred (an Order, Chargeback, Refund, Subscription, Checkout, OneOffProduct, or SubscriptionPlan), keyed by its own ",[214,411,276],{}," field. Note ",[214,414,415],{},"object.resource"," can differ from ",[214,418,356],{},": chargeback events carry ",[214,421,422],{},"entityType: order"," but a Chargeback ",[214,425,402],{},[235,427,428,433,437],{},[253,429,430],{},[214,431,432],{},"cr